	)
	(text "Corners: FPGA driver 26 / 36 / 44 ohm, VCCO 1.14 / 1.20 / 1.26 V, resistors 1 %.\n\nCA0-6, CK_P, CK_N:  91 R / 68 R   0.378 / 0.418 / 0.468 V   pin current 6.9 mA max\n    back impedance 44.6 ohm into the 45.6 ohm In3 line; limit: DC level <= 0.47 V target, <= 0.488 V\n        (card VDDQ min) hard; >= 0.351 V at boot (default VREF(CA) 0.256 V max + 0.095 V)\n\nCS0:  33 R / 100 R   0.640 / 0.710 / 0.797 V   pin current 8.0 mA max\n    limit: 0.55 V (ViHPD) .. VDD2H + 0.2 V; Vref_CS = VDD2H / 3 = 0.35 V\n\nFPGA: SSTL12 / DIFF_SSTL12, RDRV_40_40, FAST.\nCK_P on finger 76 (P pin), CK_N on finger 74 (N pin); finger 75 between them stays open.\nAll 10 nets are delay matched FPGA die pad to ball within +/-2 ps (CK_P to CK_N +/-1 ps)\non In3 between two ground planes; see design/DESIGN.md section 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.08 49.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "166d833f-6ce6-5898-a325-294b21d2df08")
	)
